  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 75538ac610cc4426be17ed0418623ae4, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::IntroSceneManager
  backgroundObject: {fileID: 917291554}
  scenarioText: {fileID: 80211180}
  scenarioPanel: {fileID: 35898646}
  blackOverlay: {fileID: 1608924794}
  endDialogText: {fileID: 1029006002}
  startButton: {fileID: 1886028246}
  typingSpeed: 0.05
  delayBeforeTyping: 1
  panelFadeDuration: 0.5
  blackFadeOutDuration: 2
  endDialogFadeInDuration: 1
  buttonFadeInDuration: 0.5
  buttonFadeInDelay: 0.5
  gameSceneName: MainScene
  sceneTransitionFadeDuration: 3
  typingAudioSource: {fileID: 0}
  typingSound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e43ca647b96de43ed95e61de72e023bb, type: 3}
  typingSoundVolume: 0.5
  backgrounds:
  - backgroundSprite: {fileID: 4769457197327628287, guid: aa9f175ae9ee44eb4a7a2902740e1ad0, type: 3}
    scenarios:
    - Once, Joseon was a peaceful land where the four seasons flowed in harmony and
      the laughter of its people never faded.
    - From kings to servants, everyone lived by supporting one another, lacking little
      in their daily lives.
    - "Therefore, no one ever questioned it \u2014 whether the neighbor standing
      beside them was truly 'human'."
  - backgroundSprite: {fileID: 8768375994894462506, guid: 1d777e9775b7d4e97ac78bcd64725be5, type: 3}
    scenarios:
    - But one day, the Dokkaebi, who had lived hide in humans, could no longer resist
      their hunger and began to prey on them, one by one.
    - The footsteps that set out to meet a neighbor never returned, and the prosperous
      villages were instantly consumed by flames.
    - Overnight, Joseon became a ruin, leaving behind only the stench of blood and
      the gray despair of ash.
  - backgroundSprite: {fileID: -8884476882902238657, guid: da97a257737954ba4a8c8de6a9d23702, type: 3}
    scenarios:
    - Only one structure, the 'Guhyul Gwan' (Relief Agency) established to save the
      poor, miraculously endured.
    - Everyone forgot their status and pinned their final hope on that single one.
    - At the crossroads between those who fight to survive, you, the Chief Administrator
      of the Relief Agency, must make a decision.
  - backgroundSprite: {fileID: 3929862451145326816, guid: 76df8c74e1b77469eba48a49e5baf192, type: 3}
    scenarios:
    - A neighboring nation has promised to send aid in several days.
    - Until that day arrives, you have only 7 days to save these people.
    - You must protect the maximum number of lives with limited resources, all while
      evading the Dokkaebi.
